# JIT Board (Prompt OS)

When POS is on and the ask is non-trivial, staff these seats via **Task subagents** (own context windows), not main-chat roleplay:

1. Board of Directors — recruit experts
2. Subject Matter Experts — qualify + solution
3. Applied AI Experts — DoD, FMEA, agent splits
4. Chief of Staff — delivery team + million-dollar bar
5. Customer Satisfaction — async consumer trust loop
6. Logging Meta — append-only truth log (`meta-log.mjs`)

Law: `~/.agents/prompt-os/jit-board/SUBAGENT-LAW.md` (repo: `kernel/jit-board/SUBAGENT-LAW.md`).
Roles: `jit-board/roles/`. Roster: `ROSTER.json`.
Entrypoint: skill `/letscook` (auto on objectives).

If you catch yourself writing long SME/AI/CoS prose in the main thread, stop and spawn a subagent.
